<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#080808">
<title>SENSI FF — Gerador</title>

<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif}

body{
  min-height:100vh;
  color:white;
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at top,#350000 0%,#100000 35%,#050505 75%);
}

.container{
  width:92%;
  max-width:850px;
  margin:auto;
  padding:25px 0 50px;
}

header{text-align:center;padding:20px 5px}

.logo{
  font-size:42px;
  font-weight:900;
  color:#ff2222;
  text-shadow:0 0 12px #ff0000,0 0 30px #990000;
}

.subtitle{color:#aaa;margin-top:8px}

.card{
  margin-top:20px;
  padding:22px;
  border-radius:18px;
  background:#111;
  border:1px solid #401010;
  box-shadow:0 0 25px rgba(255,0,0,.12);
}

label{
  display:block;
  margin-bottom:8px;
  font-weight:bold;
}

select{
  width:100%;
  padding:15px;
  border-radius:12px;
  border:1px solid #551515;
  background:#080808;
  color:white;
  font-size:16px;
}

button{
  cursor:pointer;
}

.generate{
  width:100%;
  margin-top:18px;
  padding:17px;
  border:0;
  border-radius:12px;
  background:linear-gradient(90deg,#a90000,#ff2222);
  color:white;
  font-size:17px;
  font-weight:900;
  box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(255,0,0,.3);
}

.result{display:none}

.device{
  text-align:center;
  color:#ff3333;
  font-size:23px;
  font-weight:bold;
}

.profile{
  text-align:center;
  color:#888;
  margin:8px 0 20px;
}

.settings{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
  gap:12px;
}

.setting{
  padding:17px;
  text-align:center;
  background:#090909;
  border:1px solid #292929;
  border-radius:13px;
}

.setting strong{
  display:block;
  color:#999;
  font-size:13px;
  margin-bottom:8px;
}

.value{
  color:#ff2929;
  font-size:26px;
  font-weight:900;
}

.highlight{
  border-color:#741515;
}

.copy{
  width:100%;
  margin-top:18px;
  padding:15px;
  border-radius:12px;
  border:1px solid #601515;
  background:#1b0505;
  color:white;
  font-weight:bold;
}

.info{
  margin-top:18px;
  padding:14px;
  color:#aaa;
  font-size:13px;
  line-height:1.5;
  border-left:4px solid #ff2222;
  background:#090909;
  border-radius:8px;
}

footer{
  text-align:center;
  color:#666;
  font-size:12px;
  margin-top:25px;
}

@media(max-width:600px){
  .logo{font-size:34px}
  .settings{grid-template-columns:1fr}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

<header>
<div class="logo">🔥 SENSI FF</div>
<div class="subtitle">
Gerador de Sensibilidade • Equilibrada • Full Vermelho
</div>
</header>

<div class="card">

<label>📱 Escolha seu celular</label>

<select id="device">

<option value="motoG5GPlus">Motorola Moto G 5G Plus</option>
<option value="motoG54">Motorola Moto G54</option>
<option value="motoG84">Motorola Moto G84</option>
<option value="motoG85">Motorola Moto G85</option>
<option value="motoG73">Motorola Moto G73</option>

<option value="a14">Samsung Galaxy A14</option>
<option value="a24">Samsung Galaxy A24</option>
<option value="a34">Samsung Galaxy A34</option>
<option value="a54">Samsung Galaxy A54</option>

<option value="note12">Xiaomi Redmi Note 12</option>
<option value="note13">Xiaomi Redmi Note 13</option>
<option value="pocoX5">POCO X5</option>
<option value="pocoX6">POCO X6</option>

<option value="iphone11">iPhone 11</option>
<option value="iphone12">iPhone 12</option>
<option value="iphone13">iPhone 13</option>
<option value="iphone14">iPhone 14</option>
<option value="iphone15">iPhone 15</option>

</select>

<button class="generate" onclick="gerar()">
🎯 GERAR MINHA SENSI
</button>

</div>

<div class="card result" id="resultado">

<div class="device" id="nome"></div>

<div class="profile">
🔥 Perfil Equilibrado / Full Vermelho
</div>

<div class="settings">

<div class="setting highlight">
<strong>🔴 Geral</strong>
<span class="value" id="geral"></span>
</div>

<div class="setting highlight">
<strong>🎯 Ponto Vermelho</strong>
<span class="value" id="red"></span>
</div>

<div class="setting">
<strong>🔍 Mira 2x</strong>
<span class="value" id="x2"></span>
</div>

<div class="setting">
<strong>🔭 Mira 4x</strong>
<span class="value" id="x4"></span>
</div>

<div class="setting">
<strong>🎯 Mira AWM</strong>
<span class="value" id="awm"></span>
</div>

<div class="setting">
<strong>👁️ Câmera Livre</strong>
<span class="value" id="livre"></span>
</div>

<div class="setting highlight">
<strong>🔘 Tamanho do Botão</strong>
<span class="value" id="botao"></span>
</div>

<div class="setting highlight">
<strong>📱 DPI</strong>
<span class="value" id="dpi"></span>
</div>

</div>

<button class="copy" onclick="copiar()">
📋 COPIAR CONFIGURAÇÃO
</button>

<div class="info">
⚠️ Os valores são sugestões. A sensibilidade ideal varia conforme
o aparelho, tela, controles e preferência do jogador.
</div>

</div>

<footer>
SENSI FF © 2026
</footer>

</div>

